# Open School Environment Variables

## Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/open_school

## Auth (Supabase or Custom JWT)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxx.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=your-service-key-here
JWT_SECRET=change-this-to-a-random-string-at-least-32-chars-long

## AI (Optional — Local Ollama for tutors)
OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.2:3b

## Features
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_OFFLINE=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_VOICE=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LANGUAGE=es
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPPORTED_LANGUAGES=es,en,pt-BR,ca

## Analytics (Privacy-first — default OFF for youth platforms)
ENABLE_ANALYTICS=false
